ing the morning peak, to pass through its gatelines and those at the adjoining station at Monument. A further 50,000 passengers squeeze into the station complex at exactly the same time of day, in order to change between the five lines that pass through it.","frame_run_id":16,"frame_seq":15,"frame_ts_ms":1792297676307,"id":"bank|proper_noun|2","lemma":"bank","norm":"bank","pos":"proper_noun","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","pos_raw:name"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":5,"word":"bank"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"A surname.","example":null,"frame_run_id":16,"frame_seq":15,"frame_ts_ms":1792297676307,"id":"bank|proper_noun|3","lemma":"bank","norm":"bank","pos":"proper_noun","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:2","cat:en:english surnames","pos_raw:name"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":5,"word":"bank"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(form-of, participle, past) simple past and past participle of deposit","example":null,"frame_run_id":16,"frame_seq":15,"frame_ts_ms":1792297676307,"id":"deposited|verb|1","lemma":"deposited","norm":"deposited","pos":"verb","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["tag:form-of","tag:participle","tag:past","pos_raw:verb"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":1,"word":"deposited"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(letter, lowercase) The ninth letter of the English alphabet, called i and written in the Latin script.","example":null,"frame_run_id":16,"frame_seq":15,"frame_ts_ms":1792297676307,"id":"i|phrase|1","lemma":"i","norm":"i","pos":"phrase","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","tag:letter","tag:lowercase","pos_raw:character"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":0,"word":"i"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(alt-of, lowercase, ordinal, number) The ordinal number ninth, derived from this letter of the English alphabet, called i and written in the Latin script.","example":null,"frame_run_id":16,"frame_seq":15,"frame_ts_ms":1792297676307,"id":"i|numeral|1","lemma":"i","norm":"i","pos":"numeral","score":0.5,"semantic_a